led per NEC\n690.56\nPass\nPlacards at service entrance, main panel, inverter\npad, disconnect\nWarning signage at combiner and DC\njunction boxes\nPass\nArc-flash and DC voltage warnings posted\nEmergency shutdown procedure posted\nPass\nLaminated procedure at inverter pad and main\ndisconnect\n\n\n---\n\nItem Result Notes\nPOI single-line diagram posted Pass Posted inside utility disconnect enclosure\nAccess clearances meet NEC 110.26 Pass 42 in. front, 30 in. side working space verified\nSection 6 — Telemetry & Communications Provisioning\nItem Result Notes\nUtility-owned RTU installed (TCS-02 §5)Pass Alleniom RTU asset RTU-LKM-171-04; installed\n06/12/2025\nSCADA point list configured Pass Real / reactive power, voltage, breaker status, alarms\nper point list rev C\nCommunications circuit provisioned Pass Cellular backhaul with primary/backup APN; signal ≥\n−78 dBm\nEnd-to-end SCADA point verification with\nSOC\nPass Verified with SOC 06/17/2025 (ref. SCADA ticket\nTKT-25-04188)\nTime synchronization verified Pass NTP lock to Alleniom master clock; drift < 50 ms\nLive telemetry available prior to PTOPass Live points received at SOC continuously since\n06/17/2025 15:20\nSection 7 — Witness Test Disposition\nWitness test: waiver eligible ■   (checkbox marked — copy-forward from application)\nWitness test: witness attendance\nrequired\nBasis cited on cover sheet Inverter model Torvane Electric TE-180K listed on Certified\nEquipment List (CEL-2025-Q2, 04/30/2025)\nStandards Engineering review Pending\nSection 8 — Field Engineer Sign-Off\nCommissioning agent (print) K. Ondras, Field Services\nCommissioning agent (signature) /s/ K. Ondras\nDate 06/18/2025\nField engineer (print) M. Halbrook, P.E., Alleniom DER Field Engineering\nField engineer (signature) /s/ M. Halbrook, P.E.\nDate 06/18/2025\nDistrict representative (print) P. Ashworth, Facilities Director, Lockmere Community School District\nDistrict representative (signature) /s/ P. Ashworth\nDate 06/18/2025\nSect