firmed live. Closure is logged against the interconnection file with SOC operator initials and timestamp.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prepared by: Lena Kovalchuk, SOC Shift Supervisor — 07/14/2025.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id="entries">Entries</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SOC PTO-Hold Log — Entries</th>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Doc no. DER-EQP-SOC-PTOH · As of 07/14/2025</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Site Name</td>\n<td>Requesting Party</td>\n<td>Request Date</td>\n<td>Reason for Refusal</td>\n<td>Standard Citation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>City of Elmsworth Northside Water Treatment Plant</td>\n<td>Bill Tran, City of Elmsworth</td>\n<td>05/15/2025</td>\n<td>RTU/SCADA telemetry not installed</td>\n<td>TCS-02 §5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Alleron Community Solar Initiative — Rowan Hill</td>\n<td>Priya Halvorsen, Rowan Hill Community Solar LLC</td>\n<td>06/10/2025</td>\n<td>RTU/SCADA telemetry not installed</td>\n<td>TCS-02 §5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Brookfen North High School Array</td>\n<td>Rosa Camarena, Brookfen USD</td>\n<td>05/02/2025</td>\n<td>RTU/SCADA telemetry not installed</td>\n<td>TCS-02 §5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Brookfen West Elementary Array</td>\n<td>Rosa Camarena, Brookfen USD</td>\n<td>06/03/2025</td>\n<td>RTU/SCADA telemetry not installed</td>\n<td>TCS-02 §5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vernand Logistics C&amp;I Rooftop PV</td>\n<td>Derrick Muhlbach, Vernand Logistics, Inc.</td>\n<td>04/12/2025</td>\n<td>RTU/SCADA telemetry not installed</td>\n<td>TCS-02 §5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Halstonfield Distribution Center PV</td>\n<td>Owen Talbert-Reyes, Halstonfield Properties LLC</td>\n<td>06/20/2025</td>\n<td>RTU/SCADA telemetry not installed</td>\n<td>TCS-02 §5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prairie Corridor Business Park PV</td>\n<td>Marisol Kettering, Prairie Corridor Development Partners</td>\n<td>07/01/2025</td>\n<td>RTU/SCADA telemetry not installed</td>\n<t