38	der-program/screening/existing-der-register-extract	00cdb6bce25a27b1a294	Existing DER Register Extract	Register extract by service address showing existing DER installations and their current status	f	t				# Existing DER Register Extract\n\n## Register\n\n| Existing-DER Register Extract |   |   |   |   |   |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Source: | Interconnection Studies — system extract |   |   |   |   |\n| Extract job: | ICS-REG-EXT / weekly |   |   |   |   |\n| As of: | 07/14/2025 |   |   |   |   |\n| Scope: | In-service or previously in-service DER sites within Alleniom Utilities service territory at or above the 500 kW reporting floor. Sub-500 kW residential and small-commercial systems are held in the Simplified Small-Systems Register and are not included in this extract. |   |   |   |   |\n| Column definitions |   |   |   |   |   |\n| Service Address | premise address of record from the customer information system. |   |   |   |   |\n| Customer | customer of record on the service account. |   |   |   |   |\n| Site Name | DER site label as carried in the interconnection master. |   |   |   |   |\n| Nameplate (kW) | as-built AC nameplate at point of interconnection. |   |   |   |   |\n| Commissioned | date of first energization from the commissioning record on file. |   |   |   |   |\n| Current Status | most recent operational / telemetry status of record. Values in this field reflect the state of the site as reported by the SOC or the last commissioning entry; the register does not evaluate suitability for standards retrofit or upgrade. Cells in this column are color-coded per the status key in Notes, item 6. |   |   |   |   |\n| Service Address | Customer | Site Name | Nameplate (kW) | Commissioned | Current Status |\n| 1420 Kettle Ridge Road, Halston, Alleron 07HA | Halston Cold Storage Co. | Kettle Ridge Rooftop PV | 640 | 06/14/2016 | telemetry: none — pre-TCS-02 |\n| 208 Foundry Street, Cordwyn, Alleron 14CW | Ironwake Metalworks LLC | Foundry Street PV | 520 | 08/02/2016 | telemetry: none — pre-TCS-02; site inactive per SOC 03/2024 |\n| 4400 Prairie Loop, Halston, Alleron 11HA | Northrail Distribution Inc. | Prairie Loop Rooftop Array | 900 | 11/17/2016 | telemetry: none — pre-TCS-02 |\n| 71 Riverbend Way, Elmsworth, Alleron 07EL | Elmsworth Community Hospital | Riverbend Hospital PV | 1150 | 04/22/2017 | telemetry: legacy analog only — pre-TCS-02 |\n| 3300 Old Depot Road, Brookfen, Alleron 12BR | Brookfen Grain Cooperative | Old Depot Grain Elevator PV | 720 | 07/19/2017 | telemetry: none — pre-TCS-02 |\n| 5800 County Road F, Merrowfield, Alleron 18ME | Merrow Creamery | Merrow Creamery Legacy PV | 800 | 09/28/2017 | telemetry: none — pre-TCS-02 |\n| 950 Larkspur Avenue, Darnwick, Alleron 21DA | Darnwick Mercantile Group | Larkspur Warehouse PV | 550 | 10/03/2017 | telemetry: none — pre-TCS-02 |\n| 1780 Cascade Boulevard, Marden Falls, Alleron 75MF | Marden Falls YMCA | Marden Falls Recreation Center PV | 610 | 03/28/2018 | telemetry: legacy dial-up only — pre-TCS-02 |\n| 12 Elder Grove Lane, Tresbay, Alleron 60TR | Tresbay Regional Airport Authority | Tresbay Airport Hangar PV | 780 | 05/11/2018 | telemetry: none — pre-TCS-02 |\n| 6600 Sawmill Road, Cravenwood, Alleron 47CR | Cravenwood Timber Products Inc. | Sawmill Road Ground-Mount PV | 1450 | 09/06/2018 | telemetry: legacy modem — pre-TCS-02 |\n| 220 Vintners Lane, Holcott, Alleron 84HO | Holcott Vineyards LLC | Holcott Vineyards PV | 500 | 11/28/2018 | telemetry: none — pre-TCS-02 |\n| 15 Waterworks Drive, Lockmere, Alleron 34LO | City of Lockmere (Water Utility) | Lockmere Booster Station PV | 560 | 06/04/2019 | telemetry: SCADA (pre-TCS-02 arrangement, city-owned) |\n| 4100 Interstate Access Road, Halston, Alleron 04HA | Draymon Fleet Services | Interstate Fleet Depot PV | 970 | 08/22/2019 | operational; telemetry: RTU installed 04/2022 (post-TCS-02 retrofit) |\n| 88 Old Post Road, Merrowfield, Alleron 18ME | Merrowfield Farm Bureau | Farm Bureau Office PV | 510 | 10/17/2019 | telemetry: none — pre-TCS-02 |\n| 2650 Junction Parkway, Cordwyn, Alleron 16CW | Junction Logistics Partners | Junction Parkway DC PV | 1250 | 02/13/2020 | operational; telemetry: RTU (TCS-02 compliant) |\n| 505 Meadow Ridge Drive, Brookfen, Alleron 12BR | Ridgewood Assisted Living LLC | Ridgewood Campus PV | 650 | 07/09/2020 | telemetry: none — pre-TCS-02 |\n| 3025 Foundry Ridge Road, Halston, Alleron 10HA | Foundry Ridge Data Center LLC | Foundry Ridge DC Rooftop PV | 1820 | 11/20/2020 | operational; telemetry: RTU (TCS-02 compliant) |\n| 480 Old Quarry Road, Elmsworth, Alleron 08EL | Old Quarry Aggregates Inc. | Old Quarry Site PV | 720 | 04/16/2021 | decommissioned 02/2024 — equipment removed; service inactive |\n| 199 Hillcrest Avenue, Tresbay, Alleron 60TR | Hillcrest Presbyterian Church | Hillcrest Community Solar | 540 | 09/30/2021 | operational; telemetry: RTU (TCS-02 compliant) |\n| 7700 Copperline Trail, Marden Falls, Alleron 75MF | Copperline Recycling LLC | Copperline MRF PV | 880 | 05/18/2022 | operational; telemetry: RTU (TCS-02 compliant) |\n| 1315 Bramble Court, Darnwick, Alleron 21DA | Bramble Court Business Park LLC | Bramble Court Business Park PV | 1030 | 10/24/2022 | operational; telemetry: RTU (TCS-02 compliant) |\n\n## Notes\n\n| Notes |   |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1. | Rows are ordered by commissioned date, oldest first, then by service address. |\n| 2. | "Pre-TCS-02" annotations indicate the site was energized before the effective date of the Telemetry & Communications Standard (TCS-02, effective 06/01/2021) and was accepted under the telemetry provisions in force at commissioning. This annotation does not confer a permanent exemption: per TCS-02 §2(d), a pre-TCS-02 site is brought into TCS-02 scope when it is the subject of a new interconnection application. Status values in this column are informational; this register does not independently determine upgrade eligibility or compliance. |\n| 3. | Sites listed as decommissioned or inactive are retained in the register for address-history purposes and are excluded from active-DER counts. |\n| 4. | Address matches are performed on normalized premise address. Multiple DER at a single service address are listed as separate rows. |\n| 5. | Extract does not include applications currently in queue (see Active Queue Report). |\n| 6. | Current Status color key: green = operational with TCS-02-compliant telemetry (utility RTU); amber = in service under a pre-TCS-02 telemetry arrangement (no telemetry or legacy analog/dial-up/modem/SCADA); red = decommissioned or inactive. |	<h1 id="existing-der-register-extract">Existing DER Register Extract</h1>\n<h2 id="register">Register</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Existing-DER Register Extract</th>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Source:</td>\n<td>Interconnection Studies — system extract</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Extract job:</td>\n<td>ICS-REG-EXT / weekly</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>As of:</td>\n<td>07/14/2025</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scope:</td>\n<td>In-service or previously in-service DER sites within Alleniom Utilities service territory at or above the 500 kW reporting floor. Sub-500 kW residential and small-commercial systems are held in the Simplified Small-Systems Register and are not included in this extract.</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Column definitions</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Service Address</td>\n<td>premise address of record from the customer information system.</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Customer</td>\n<td>customer of record on the service account.</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Site Name</td>\n<td>DER site label as carried in the